    {
      "id": "claim_4892d363622d4ef388c462188677462d",
      "statement": "Profile lifecycle operations: Add creates a profile with an auto-generated id and stores name/description in the yolo.jsonc profile element (duplicate effective name is ErrNameTaken); Remove falls the active marker back to the first remaining profile by name, or a recreated default when none remain; Copy requires a unique name and rewrites the destination as a single yolo.jsonc; Edit uses hasName/hasDesc (absent differs from empty), treats a rename to one's own effective name as a no-op, drops the profile element when both fields are empty, and never touches the id or the active marker.",
